Dialogue: 3,0:01:50.03,0:01:53.24,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Townsfolks'\NEmergency Shelter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mayor's never been\Ngone for this long before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.91,0:01:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like a battle\Nwas going on in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a lot more\Ncannon fire than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go to town to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.39,0:02:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are still pirates in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.57,0:02:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you'll need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of citizens\Nare we if we don't help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have got to find out what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't stop us from going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to do all we can to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all go together.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.28,0:02:40.74,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,715)\blur0.5\fad(979,977)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(938,979,\1a&H00&)\t(4483,4525,\1a&HFF&)}Pirate Buggy "the Clown"
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.28,0:02:40.74,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,715)\blur0.5\fad(979,977)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Pirate Buggy "the Clown"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all my life, I've never\Nbeen as mad at someone as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard Shank stole\Ncountless riches from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.11,0:02:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you two are connected,\Nbut I can say whatever I want about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've earned that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The North Pole! South Pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:02:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, and I'm gonna keep on\Nsaying it because I'm right, clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got guts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna settle this once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you bastard, I'm\Ngonna bust you up flashily!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody but you two cares which is\Ncolder, the North Pole or the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to know so badly, then\Nwhy don't you go to both and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship to the north-north-east!\NRight. Get ready. Time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.69,0:03:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to plunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem happy, Buggy. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships are just like\Nbig floating treasure chests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for\Npirates to raid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's some truth to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and everyone else here\Njust don't have the pirate's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,natural hunger and desire\Nfor plundering treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what it\Nmeans to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the treasure at the\Nbottom of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.19,0:04:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my life's path is flashily decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna come celebrate with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've found a whole lot\Nof really neat stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no map!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything hidden! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna leave\Nthis ship sometime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my own ship, then gather\Na reliable crew and see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:04:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, all as a pirate, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of sentimental\Nnonsense! Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do admire your fighting skill, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you weren't such a softy,\NI'd make you one of my henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your henchmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have completely\Ndifferent outlooks on life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I think we should just\Nfollow our own paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're such an expert on\Npirates, but if we ever meet on the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we'd have to have\Na fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pirates do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, you said something about\Nfinding some interesting loot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, we found a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that the different fruits\Nare incarnations of the sea devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, if you eat\None, you gain devil powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the sea will hate you and\Ntake your ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be stupid to eat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:06:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never get that treasure on the\Nocean floor if I couldn't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I bet you could sell that fruit\Nfor at least a hundred million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Pirate Apprentice Buggy, am\Nabout to devour this Devil Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta love the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thinking of consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel any differently yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, was it a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a real Devil Fruit before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that worked flashily well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are so gullible, I can't\Nbelieve I was able to trick them so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to jump ship before\Nthey find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the money I get from selling this\NDevil Fruit and finding the sunken treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll easily be able to form my own crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:06:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you just saying something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't steal too much\Nfood from the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to make the cook mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain told me to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong? Bastard! Why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my map!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you lose\Nyour ability to swim damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you telling me\Nthat Shank saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, that's not the point\NI'm trying to get across!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of what he did to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was unable to swim and therefore\Nunable to obtain my sunken treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I had a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I couldn't go underwater, then I'd\Njust obtain all the treasure on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using my brand new Chop Chop powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I won't let anyone\Nwho touches my treasure live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death to those who tried to build\Nfor my hard-earned treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.07,0:08:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spotted me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance\Nof escaping from me! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to flashily chop you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, my balls, my balls,\Nthat was a cheap shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run off yet, we're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you better drop that treasure\Nand get out of here, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want him coming after you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, drop the money and go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, why should I\Nleave my treasure behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.81,0:09:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just call it your treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a thief who steals from pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I just stole a lot of treasure\Nfrom a really annoying one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that makes this my\Ntreasure now, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pure nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my treasure, and just because you\Nstole it from me doesn't make it yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you dirty, sneaky thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, what did your parents teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A criminal trying to\Nlecture another criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day I take a morality lesson from\Nyou is the day I stop being a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready for the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, here comes Chop Chop Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try and save your\Nfriend for me now, Gum-Gum! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He broke up into smaller pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me back my treasure! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See how you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving me\Nmy treasure back, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let go! You let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my treasure, so get\Nyour grubby hands off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me back my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't finished dealing with me yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider that finishing move a\Nlittle gift from the old mayor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the map!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you flashily do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assemble, Chop Chop Pods!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who looking for these, Buggy? Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My box!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right! Here you go, B!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.69,0:12:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid sure's Captain Buggy flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do\Nwithout the captain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep acting unconscious. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry your hat's all torn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I got Buggy out of here,\Nso I'm satisfied for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I have time, I'll fix\Nit for you, if you like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I split this into two bags, so give\Nme a hand and carry half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too heavy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure is a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, that clown buggy knew\Nquality treasure when he saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now it's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I can sell this for\Nat least 10 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the map to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do want it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.51,0:13:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I finally have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A map of the Grand Line! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, does this also mean you'll\Nbe joining me and my pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, no matter what,\NI'll never join a pirate crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But okay, hanging around with\Nyou seems profitable enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just remember this, I'm only joining\Nyou because it's in my interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we take care of everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we got a navigator, and\Nwe got a chart of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel lightheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always something\Nwith you two, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the worst of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's go help the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we should wake the old\Nguy up now that it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not residents of this\Nvillage? Nope. And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was all that cannon fire we heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like there may have\Nbeen a battle here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know anything, please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that maybe\Nthey were more pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, mayor! Oh, no! Say\Nsomething! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out cold. The pirates definitely\Ndid this. How horrible. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who kicked that old man's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on you didn't have to tell\Nthem that did you it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should explain to\Nthem so they don't get angry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me why exactly did you\Nknock our mayor out and leave him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the street to die better\Nexplain yourselves who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you with the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're really bloodthirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.97,0:15:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let them know that\Nwe're thieves and pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates, how dare you ravage our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't show you any\Nmercy for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like they're\Nup for a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt a beloved mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you always make things worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a good town. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so mad just\Nbecause of the old mayor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me they're not gonna\Nlisten to our side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're turning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me know sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ran into the alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou? Doggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those three are pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're barking at the wrong people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he letting us pass through?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, get out of here! Woof! Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only made it because of Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to put up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is this your boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special,\Nbut I guess it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole it from some dumb\Npirates a few days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big mouth you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for\Nyou, you little thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought you'd run into\Nus here, now did you, girly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not just sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're bound together by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:18:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll have to punish\Nthe two of them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time you learn what happens\Nwhen you steal other people's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take time for your medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's waking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened here, Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like this when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were a few pirates when we\Narrived, but they all ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are those young ones? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about those three kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools, treating a\Nsenior citizen like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We drove those pirates out of town, Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make them pay for\Nwhat they've done to our village
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They deserve to be punished for\Ndestroying the peaceful town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all worked so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still time to go after\Nthem if we hold your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who's allowed\Nto complain about those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone else\Nbadmouth them You hear me? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you protecting\Nthose pirates mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think they can just\Ndisappear and that's that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.81,0:19:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well I think they were running toward the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,port Damn kids they can't\Njust leave like that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a lot of things\NI want to say to you all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right let's get going can\NI ask you something Isn't that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy's mark on your sail. Well,\Nthis did used to be Buggy's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think I should change it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:19:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the old mayor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was ready to die filled with despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.99,0:20:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you left that\Nbag of treasure back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bag was worth around five\Nmillion berries, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're gonna need\Nthat money to repair
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their destroyed town But\Nthat was my treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:20:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard I worked to steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the whole idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want it, just go\Nback and get it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go get it! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can die, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you do that again, I really\Nwill throw you in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.49,0:21:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for better or for worse, looks like\Nwe finally have a navigator in our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.99,0:21:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.65,0:22:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges, I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time\Nwhen everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.81,0:22:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream. You?

